Likelihood function used:
def computeLikelihood(self,ctx):
        model_th=ctx.get('model_th')
        diff=np.subtract(model_th,self.data).reshape(1,len(self.data))
        logl=-np.dot(diff,np.dot(self.cov_inv,diff.T))/2.
        return logl

